<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Naisha Creations</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #fdfbf9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #5e3232;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background-color: #f0ebe1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 48px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .intro-text {
            color: #666666;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .features {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            margin: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .feature {
            width: 30%;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .feature-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .btn-container {
            margin: 40px 0 20px 0;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 36px;
            background-color: #D19D94;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(209, 157, 148, 0.2);
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #c08b82;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #888888;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .social-links {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .social-links a {
            color: #1a1a1a;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <img src="" alt="Naisha Creations" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 0;" width="400" height="60" />
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
            🕯️✨🌿
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2 class="greeting">Welcome to the family, {{firstName}}!</h2>
            
            <p class="intro-text">
                We are absolutely thrilled to have you here. At Naisha Creations, we craft premium, hand-poured candles designed to bring warmth, peace, and beautiful scents into your sacred spaces.
            </p>
            
            <div class="features">
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">✨</div>
                    <div class="feature-title">Hand-Poured</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🌿</div>
                    <div class="feature-title">Premium Wax</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🎨</div>
                    <div class="feature-title">Customizable</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <p class="intro-text">
                Your account is set up and ready to go. You can now track your orders, save your favorite addresses, and start customizing your own bespoke candles.
            </p>
            
            <div class="btn-container">
                <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/collections" class="btn">Shop Our Collection</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="https://instagram.com/naishacreations_withlove">Instagram</a> | <a href="{{frontendUrl}}">Website</a>
            </div>
            &copy; {{year}} Naisha Creations. All rights reserved.<br>
            If you have any questions, reply to this email or contact us at <a href="mailto:support@naishacreations.com">support@naishacreations.com</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>